Root cause:
The bug was caused by incorrectly replacing the pointer of the next skb in the descriptor ring instead of the current one, leading to two descriptors being assigned the same SKB. This resulted in memory corruption when attempting to insert a second packet, as the buffer was exceeded during the iperf test.
